   "text": "Figure 13. Population-weighted mean effective kernels of the mixed model on the matched one-hour validation cohort: (a)–(d)\nthe 3×3, 5×5, 7×7 and 9×9 branches and (e) their embedded sum, on the 9×9 grid of 375 m source offsets (grey: outside the\nbranch's support; plus: the fixed zero centre). Each panel has its own linear colour bar, in 10⁻⁴ h⁻¹. Rebuilt from the preprint's\nvector figure (no saved matrices): cell colours read against each colour bar and scaled so each kernel's sum equals the\npreprint table; rebuilt minima and maxima are compared with the table in SOURCES.md. Source: preprint Figure\nfig:results:kernel-matrices and Table kernel_matrix_summary_table.",
